      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "Quantum conjugacy changes the proposed CPT quotient from a pointwise spacetime identification into a representation-aware phase-space boundary: the noncommuting U,V coordinates obstruct simultaneous sharp pairing, their area-preserving inversion extensions close as D4, and the chosen T2+ pairing is imposed on both Fourier-related in/out parity sectors along UV=plus-or-minus h.",
